[2026-03-14T20:28:31.955Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FeTQuBkDPpAGvyoeT61UCM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report.\n\n## Comprehensive Airbnb Clone App Exploration Report\n\n### 1. App Directory Name\n**Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n### 2. Overall File Structure\n\n```\n/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/\n├── AppSpec.md                          # Application specification\n├── docs/\n│   └── tests.md                        # Comprehensive test specifications (extensive file with all test scenarios)\n├── src/\n│   ├── App.tsx                         # Main application component\n│   ├── index.css                       # Global styles\n│   ├── main.tsx                        # Entry point\n│   ├── store.ts                        # Redux store configuration\n│   ├── components/                     # React components (32 files)\n│   ├── pages/                          # Page components (6 files)\n│   └── slices/                         # Redux slices for state management (9 files)\n├── tests/                              # Playwright test files (9 test suites)\n├── netlify/\n│   └── functions/                      # Netlify serverless functions (12 API endpoints)\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── check.ts\n│   ├── deploy.ts\n│   ├── schema.ts\n│   ├── seed-db.ts                      # Database seeding script\n│   └── test.ts\n├── playwright.config.ts                # Playwright configuration\n├── vite.config.ts                      # Vite bundler configuration\n├── package.json                        # Project dependencies\n├── netlify.toml                        # Netlify configuration\n├── tsconfig.json                       # TypeScript configuration\n├── eslint.config.js                    # ESLint configuration\n└── index.html                          # HTML entry point\n```\n\n### 3. Test Files That Already Exist\n\nLocated in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`:\n\n1. **auth.spec.ts** (8,965 bytes) - Authentication and registration tests\n2. **category-filter.spec.ts** (5,640 bytes) - Category filtering tests\n3. **favorite-button.spec.ts** (6,839 bytes) - Favorite button functionality tests\n4. **filters-panel.spec.ts** (12,870 bytes) - Advanced filters panel tests\n5. **image-gallery.spec.ts** (5,757 bytes) - Image gallery display tests\n6. **pagination.spec.ts** (8,291 bytes) - Pagination control tests\n7. **property-grid.spec.ts** (6,450 bytes) - Property grid layout tests\n8. **property-detail.spec.ts** (8,512 bytes) - Property detail page tests\n9. **search.spec.ts** (6,246 bytes) - Search functionality tests\n\n### 4. Test Specifications from docs/tests.md\n\nThe `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` file contains comprehensive test specifications organized by:\n\n**Page: Login / Register (`/login`)**\n- AuthToggle component tests\n- LoginForm component tests\n- RegisterForm component tests\n\n**Page: Home / Search (`/`)**\n- SearchBar tests (11 tests covering location, dates, guests, combined search, etc.)\n- CategoryFilter tests (8 tests for property type filtering)\n- PropertyGrid tests (3 tests for grid layout and empty states)\n- PropertyCard tests (5 tests for display and navigation)\n- FavoriteButton tests (8 tests for favorite functionality)\n- FiltersPanel tests (14 tests covering price, beds, bathrooms, amenities, combinations)\n- Pagination tests\n\n**Page: Property Detail (`/properties/:id`)**\n- PropertyHeader tests\n- PropertyInfo tests\n- PropertyDescription tests\n- AmenitiesList tests (9 tests covering display, grouping, show/hide functionality)\n- BookingCard tests (18+ tests covering date selection, price breakdown, reservation, validation)\n- ReviewsSection tests\n- HostInfoCard tests\n\n### 5. Playwright Configuration\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Key Settings:**\n- **Test Directory:** `./tests`\n- **Timeout:** 60,000ms (test level), 10,000ms (expect level)\n- **Parallel Execution:** Disabled (`fullyParallel: false`)\n- **Workers:** 1\n- **Reporters:** \n  - Replay.io reporter (for debugging)\n  - JSON reporter (output: `test-results/results.json`)\n  - HTML reporter (never open in CI)\n- **Base URL:** `http://localhost:8888`\n- **Web Server:** Netlify dev server on port 8888\n- **Recording:** Uses Replay.io Chromium device\n- **Trace:** Recorded on first retry\n- **Action Timeout:** 15,000ms\n\n### 6. Seed Data\n\nLocated in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`, the database is seeded with:\n\n**Users (4 total):**\n1. Sarah Chen (host) - sarah@example.com\n2. Mike Johnson (host) - mike@example.com\n3. Emma Wilson (guest) - emma@example.com\n4. Alex Rivera (guest) - alex@example.com\n\n**Properties (5 total):**\n1. **Cozy Downtown Loft with City Views** (b1111111...) - New York, NY - $150/night, 1 bed, 2 beds, 1 bath, 4 guests, Sarah Chen host\n2. **Beachfront Villa with Private Pool** (b2222222...) - Miami, FL - $450/night, 4 beds, 5 beds, 3 bath, 8 guests, Sarah Chen host\n3. **Mountain Cabin Retreat** (b3333333...) - Asheville, NC - $200/night, 3 beds, 4 beds, 2 bath, 6 guests, Mike Johnson host\n4. **Modern Austin Apartment** (b4444444...) - Austin, TX - $120/night, 1 bed, 1 bed, 1 bath, 2 guests, Mike Johnson host\n5. **Historic Townhouse in Georgetown** (b5555555...) - Washington, DC - $275/night, 3 beds, 3 beds, 2 bath, 6 guests, Sarah Chen host\n\n**Amenities (18 total):**\n- Essentials: WiFi, Kitchen, Air conditioning, Heating, Washer, TV\n- Features: Pool, Hot tub, Free parking, Gym, EV charger\n- Safety: Smoke alarm, Carbon monoxide alarm, First aid kit, Fire extinguisher\n- Location: Beachfront, Waterfront, Ski-in/Ski-out\n\n**Bookings (6 total)** - Various statuses (completed, confirmed, pending, cancelled)\n\n### 7. Components: Amenities\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/AmenitiesList.tsx`\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Displays amenities grouped by category\n- Shows only 10 amenities initially with \"Show all X amenities\" toggle\n- Maps amenity names to Lucide icons (WiFi, Car, Tv, Flame, Snowflake, Waves, etc.)\n- Responsive grid layout (1 column on mobile, 2 columns on tablet+)\n- Displays \"No amenities listed\" when property has none\n\n**Data-TestID Attributes:**\n- `amenities-list` - Main container\n- `amenity-{amenity.id}` - Individual amenity item\n- `amenities-toggle` - Show all/less button\n\n**State Management:**\n- Local state for `showAll` toggle (useState)\n\n### 8. Components: Booking Card\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx`\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Sticky positioned card on detail page\n- Displays nightly price prominently\n- Date pickers for check-in/check-out\n- Guest count selector (1 to max_guests)\n- Price breakdown showing:\n  - Nightly cost × nights\n  - Cleaning fee\n  - Total price\n- \"Reserve\" button with multiple states:\n  - Login prompt if not logged in\n  - Disabled when dates not selected or user is owner\n  - Shows \"Reserving...\" while loading\n- Error and success message display\n\n**Data-TestID Attributes:**\n- `booking-card` - Main container\n- `booking-checkin` - Check-in date input\n- `booking-checkout` - Check-out date input\n- `booking-guests` - Guest count selector\n- `price-breakdown` - Price breakdown section\n- `own-property-message` - Message when user is property owner\n- `booking-login-prompt` - Login button\n- `reserve-button` - Reserve button\n- `booking-error` - Error message\n- `booking-success` - Success message\n\n**State Management:**\n- Redux for currentUser, loading, error (from state.bookings)\n- Local state for checkIn, checkOut, guests, success\n- Validates dates, prevents past dates, ensures checkout > checkin\n- Calculates nights and total price\n\n**Validation & Logic:**\n- Prevents selecting past dates\n- Ensures checkout date is after checkin date\n- Validates guest count doesn't exceed max_guests\n- Prevents hosts from booking their own properties\n- Redirects to login if not authenticated\n- Shows success message and redirects to /trips on successful booking\n\n### 9. Netlify Functions Related to Amenities and Bookings\n\n**Amenities Endpoint:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/amenities.ts`\n- **Method:** GET\n- **Response:** Returns all amenities ordered by category and name\n- **Query:** None\n\n**Bookings Endpoints:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n- **POST /api/bookings** - Create new booking\n  - Required fields: property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price\n  - Optional: special_requests\n  - Validates no overlapping bookings exist for the date range\n  - Returns created booking with 201 status\n  \n- **PUT /api/bookings/:id** - Update booking status\n  - Accepts status: 'confirmed' or 'cancelled'\n  - Returns updated booking\n  \n- **GET /api/bookings** - Fetch guest's bookings\n  - Requires: guest_id (query parameter)\n  - Returns bookings with associated property details (title, city, country, image, review status)\n  - Ordered by check_in date ascending\n\n### Summary Statistics\n\n- **Total Components:** 32 component files\n- **Total Pages:** 6 page files\n- **Total Redux Slices:** 9 state management files\n- **Total Netlify Functions:** 12 API endpoints\n- **Total Test Files:** 9 Playwright spec files\n- **Database Entities:** Users, Properties, Amenities, Bookings, Reviews, Favorites, PropertyImages, PropertyAmenities\n- **Total Amenities Seeded:** 18 across 4 categories\n- **Total Properties Seeded:** 5 properties with images\n- **Total Users Seeded:** 4 users (2 hosts, 2 guests)\n- **Technology Stack:** React 18, Redux Toolkit, React Router 7, Playwright, Vite, TypeScript, Netlify Functions"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a44f7642c7466a567 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 56082\ntool_uses: 27\nduration_ms: 58789</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session