[2026-03-14T20:28:52.801Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W5HxX11r8rbGkuHFVdqH6m","type":"tool_result","content":"447:### Component: AmenitiesList\n448-\n449-#### Test: Amenities list displays amenities grouped by category with icons\n450-- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with amenities including \"WiFi\" (Essentials), \"Pool\" (Features), \"Smoke Detector\" (Safety), \"Near Beach\" (Location).\n451-- **Expected:** The amenities are displayed in groups with category headings: \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\". Each amenity is shown with its icon and name.\n452-\n453-#### Test: Amenities list only shows categories that have amenities\n454-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The property has amenities only in \"Essentials\" and \"Features\" categories (none in \"Safety\" or \"Location\").\n455-- **Expected:** Only the \"Essentials\" and \"Features\" category groups are displayed. Empty categories are not shown.\n456-\n457-#### Test: Amenities list shows \"Show all amenities\" when there are many amenities\n458-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with more than 10 amenities.\n459-- **Expected:** An initial subset of amenities is displayed with a \"Show all X amenities\" button at the bottom (where X is the total count).\n460-\n461-#### Test: Clicking \"Show all amenities\" reveals the complete list\n462-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with many amenities and a \"Show all X amenities\" button visible.\n463-- **Action:** User clicks \"Show all X amenities\".\n464-- **Expected:** All amenities are displayed, grouped by category. The button changes to \"Show less\" or disappears.\n465-\n466-#### Test: Amenities list displays message when property has no amenities\n467-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no amenities.\n468-- **Expected:** A message like \"No amenities listed\" is displayed, or the amenities section is not shown.\n469-\n470-### Component: BookingCard\n471-\n472-#### Test: Booking card displays price per night\n473-- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with price_per_night $150.\n474-- **Expected:** The booking card (sticky sidebar on desktop) shows \"$150 / night\" prominently at the top.\n475-\n476-#### Test: Booking card displays check-in and check-out date pickers\n477-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n478-- **Expected:** The booking card contains a check-in date picker and a check-out date picker. Both are initially empty or show placeholder text.\n479-\n480-#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n481-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 6.\n482-- **Expected:** The booking card contains a guest count selector. The selector enforces a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 6 (the property's max_guests value).\n483-\n484-#### Test: Selecting dates and guests shows price breakdown\n485-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with price_per_night $150 and cleaning_fee $75.\n486-- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" (3 nights) and sets guests to 2.\n487-- **Expected:** The booking card displays a price breakdown: \"$150 x 3 nights = $450\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $525\". The breakdown appears after both dates are selected.\n488-\n489-#### Test: Price breakdown updates when dates change\n490-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" selected (3 nights).\n491-- **Action:** User changes the check-out date to \"2026-05-06\" (5 nights).\n492-- **Expected:** The price breakdown updates to reflect 5 nights: \"$150 x 5 nights = $750\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $825\".\n493-\n494-#### Test: Reserve button creates a booking when logged in\n495-- **Initial state:** User is logged in, on a property detail page for another user's property. Check-in \"2026-05-01\", check-out \"2026-05-04\", and 2 guests are selected.\n496-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n497-- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/bookings` with the property_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, and total_price. A success message is displayed (e.g., \"Booking confirmed!\") and the user is redirected to the My Trips page (`/trips`), or a confirmation is shown on the same page.\n498-\n499-#### Test: Reserve button is disabled when dates are not selected\n500-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on a property detail page. No dates have been selected.\n501-- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled/grayed out and not clickable. A hint message like \"Select dates to book\" may be displayed.\n502-\n503-#### Test: Reserve button prompts login when user is not logged in\n504-- **Initial state:** User is not logged in and is on a property detail page with valid dates and guests selected.\n505-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n506-- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). Alternatively, a message like \"Please log in to book\" is displayed.\n507-\n508-#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n509-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as the host of the current property. Dates and guests are selected.\n510-- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled or hidden. A message like \"You cannot book your own property\" is displayed.\n511-\n512-#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n513-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n514-- **Action:** User opens the check-in date picker.\n515-- **Expected:** Dates before today are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected.\n516-\n517-#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date\n518-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page and has selected check-in \"2026-05-01\".\n519-- **Action:** User opens the check-out date picker.\n520-- **Expected:** Dates on or before \"2026-05-01\" are disabled/grayed out. Only dates after the check-in date are selectable.\n521-\n522-#### Test: Guest count cannot exceed property max_guests\n523-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 4.\n524-- **Action:** User tries to set the guest count higher than 4.\n525-- **Expected:** The guest count selector prevents selecting more than 4 guests. The maximum is capped at 4.\n526-\n527-#### Test: Guest count minimum is 1\n528-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n529-- **Action:** User interacts with the guest count selector.\n530-- **Expected:** The minimum selectable value is 1. The user cannot set guests to 0 or a negative number.\n531-\n532-#### Test: Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n533-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on a property detail page. The property has an existing confirmed booking for \"2026-05-01\" to \"2026-05-04\".\n534-- **Action:** User selects overlapping dates (e.g., check-in \"2026-05-02\", check-out \"2026-05-06\") and clicks \"Reserve\".\n535-- **Expected:** An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Property is not available for the selected dates\"). The booking is not created.\n536-\n537-#### Test: Booking card is sticky on desktop viewport\n538-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page on a desktop viewport.\n539-- **Action:** User scrolls down the page past the booking card's initial position.\n540-- **Expected:** The booking card remains visible in a sticky sidebar position as the user scrolls through the property description, amenities, and reviews.\n541-\n542-#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n543-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n544-- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\", then changes check-in to \"2026-06-01\" and check-out to \"2026-06-05\", then changes guest count from 2 to 4 and back to 2.\n545-- **Expected:** Each change correctly updates the price breakdown. The final state shows \"2026-06-01\" to \"2026-06-05\" with 2 guests.\n546-\n547-### Component: ReviewsSection\n548-\n549-#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n550-- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with multiple reviews. The average ratings are: cleanliness 4.5, accuracy 4.2, communication 4.8, location 4.6, value 4.0.\n551-- **Expected:** The reviews section shows a summary with average ratings for each category: \"Cleanliness: 4.5\", \"Accuracy: 4.2\", \"Communication: 4.8\", \"Location: 4.6\", \"Value: 4.0\". Each rating is displayed with a star icon or progress bar. An overall average rating is also displayed.\n552-\n553-#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n554-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with 15 reviews and an overall average rating of 4.3.\n555-- **Expected:** The reviews section header shows a star icon with \"4.3\" and \"15 reviews\" (or similar format like \"4.3 · 15 reviews\").\n556-\n557-#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n558-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A review exists from guest \"Alice\" dated \"2026-01-15\" with rating 5 and comment \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n559-- **Expected:** An individual review card is displayed showing the guest name \"Alice\", the date \"January 2026\" (or similar formatted date), a star rating of 5, and the comment text \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n560-\n561-#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n562-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A reviewer has an avatar_url set, another reviewer does not.\n563-- **Expected:** Review cards show the guest's avatar image when available. When no avatar is set, a placeholder (e.g., first initial in a circle) is displayed.\n564-\n565-#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n566-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no reviews.\n567-- **Expected:** The reviews section displays a message like \"No reviews yet\" instead of an empty review list. Category average ratings are not shown."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd3c410d-9cf5-43fa-a4b5-cf8b0a16bc4d","uuid":"487598d8-0b9e-4ec2-b999-cfd08113fd33","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"447:### Component: AmenitiesList\n448-\n449-#### Test: Amenities list displays amenities grouped by category with icons\n450-- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with amenities including \"WiFi\" (Essentials), \"Pool\" (Features), \"Smoke Detector\" (Safety), \"Near Beach\" (Location).\n451-- **Expected:** The amenities are displayed in groups with category headings: \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\". Each amenity is shown with its icon and name.\n452-\n453-#### Test: Amenities list only shows categories that have amenities\n454-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The property has amenities only in \"Essentials\" and \"Features\" categories (none in \"Safety\" or \"Location\").\n455-- **Expected:** Only the \"Essentials\" and \"Features\" category groups are displayed. Empty categories are not shown.\n456-\n457-#### Test: Amenities list shows \"Show all amenities\" when there are many amenities\n458-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with more than 10 amenities.\n459-- **Expected:** An initial subset of amenities is displayed with a \"Show all X amenities\" button at the bottom (where X is the total count).\n460-\n461-#### Test: Clicking \"Show all amenities\" reveals the complete list\n462-- **Initial s