 state:** User is on the My Trips page with the \"Past\" tab selected.\n632-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Upcoming\" tab.\n633-- **Expected:** The \"Upcoming\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show upcoming bookings again.\n634-\n635-#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n636-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no completed bookings.\n637-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n638-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab content area displays a message like \"No past trips\" or \"You don't have any past trips yet.\" instead of an empty list.\n639-\n640-#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n641-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no pending or confirmed future bookings.\n642-- **Action:** User views the \"Upcoming\" tab (default).\n643-- **Expected:** The tab content area displays a message like \"No upcoming trips\" with a suggestion to browse properties (e.g., a link to the home page).\n644-\n645-#### Test: Cancelled tab empty state message\n646-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no cancelled bookings.\n647-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cancelled\" tab.\n648-- **Expected:** The tab content area displays a message like \"No cancelled trips.\"\n649-\n650-#### Test: Tabs are functional on repeated use\n651-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page.\n652-- **Action:** User clicks \"Past\", then \"Cancelled\", then \"Upcoming\", then \"Past\" again.\n653-- **Expected:** Each click correctly updates the selected tab highlight and displays the correct set of bookings. The final state shows the \"Past\" tab selected with completed bookings displayed.\n654-\n655-### Component: TripCard\n656-\n657-#### Test: Trip card displays all required information\n658-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. A booking exists for property \"Beach House\" in \"Malibu\" with check_in \"2026-05-01\", check_out \"2026-05-05\", status \"confirmed\", and total_price $800. The property has an image.\n659-- **Expected:** The trip card displays: the property's main image, property title \"Beach House\", city \"Malibu\", dates \"May 1 – May 5, 2026\" (or similar formatted date range), a status badge showing \"Confirmed\" in green, and the total price \"$800\".\n660-\n661-#### Test: Trip card displays correct status badge colors\n662-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. Bookings exist with different statuses.\n663-- **Expected:** Status badges use the correct colors: \"Pending\" badge in yellow, \"Confirmed\" badge in green, \"Cancelled\" badge in red, \"Completed\" badge in blue.\n664-\n665-#### Test: Trip card shows property image or placeholder\n666-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. One booking has a property with images, another has a property with no images.\n667-- **Expected:** The trip card for the property with images shows the main property image. The trip card for the property without images shows a placeholder image.\n668-\n669-#### Test: Clicking trip card navigates to booking details\n670-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page. A trip card is displayed for a booking with id \"booking-123\".","numLines":201}}
